Package: c0pl4nd
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Itasha.Corp <c0pl4nd@itasha-corp.example>
Depends: libc6, libxcb1, libxcb-render0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libfontconfig1
Homepage: https://github.com/46b-ETYKiAL/C0PL4ND
Description: Fast, cross-platform terminal emulator
 C0PL4ND is a cross-platform terminal emulator written in Rust. It provides
 a fast rendering pipeline and runs on Windows, Linux, and macOS.
 .
 This package installs the c0pl4nd binary, an XDG desktop entry, icons, the
 man page, and the license texts the bundled typefaces require.
